WEBVTT

00:07:27.401 --> 00:07:30.654
My team and I also have worked together
to incorporate game mechanics

00:07:30.654 --> 00:07:32.031
such as chance and jeopardy,

00:07:32.031 --> 00:07:34.492
where children actually
can earn extra points

00:07:34.492 --> 00:07:38.496
when they collaborate and help each other
with difficult trivia questions.

00:07:38.496 --> 00:07:40.206
This has been intended to make sure

00:07:40.206 --> 00:07:43.375
that children actually are learning
the components of communication

00:07:43.375 --> 00:07:44.835
and working together in teams.

00:07:44.877 --> 00:07:47.421
But also it makes learning
become more child-centered.

00:07:47.463 --> 00:07:50.341
And actually, teachers can focus
on groups of children

00:07:50.382 --> 00:07:52.009
that are struggling most,

00:07:52.051 --> 00:07:54.220
a model that we are finding
to be very helpful

00:07:54.220 --> 00:07:56.013
in communities such as refugee camps,

00:07:56.055 --> 00:07:59.058
where most of the time
we don't have enough teachers.

00:07:59.099 --> 00:08:00.684
And there's one particular reason